  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreNavigationError:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Is cosúil go bhfuil fadhbanna nascachta againn - b'fhéidir nach bhfuil tú nasctha leis an Idirlíon, nó gur muidne is cúis leis an bhfadhb. Tá Ráiteas Príobháideachais Microsoft ar fáil duit, níl le déanamh ach aka.ms/privacy a chlóscríobh i mbarra seoltaí aon bhrabhsálaí ar ghléas ar bith.
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreLinkText:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Faigh tuilleadh eolais maidir le cosaint cuntais
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Tá braiteoir méarloirg ar do ghléas a oibríonn le Windows Hello, rud a thugann bealach simplí gan phasfhocal duit chun d'aitheantas a fhíorú.
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Oibríonn do cheamara le Windows Hello chun tú a aithint, agus bealach simplí gan phasfhocal a thabhairt duit chun d'aitheantas a fhíorú.
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Deilbhín méarloirg Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Follow the instructions to teach your PC to read your fingerprints
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC, quick as a wink, with just your face. No wink required. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Deilbhín aghaidhe Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Ok, hold still for a second. We need to learn to recognize you
