  \hello\LeadTextFaceFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Roghnaigh slí chun síniú isteach i Windows. Is féidir leat <strong>Aghaidh</strong> nó <strong>Méarlorg</strong> a rá chun Windows Hello a thosú.
  \hello\LeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Roghnaigh nó abair <strong>Lean ar aghaidh</strong> chun Windows Hello a chumrú.
