  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: I mbeagán focal, is mise do chúntóir pearsanta.<br/>Bím ullamh i gcónaí.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Haigh, mise Cortana.<br/>Táim anseo chun rudaí a dhéanamh níos fusa duit agus cabhrú leat rudaí a dhéanamh.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Is é Cortana do chúntóir, agus tá sé réidh chun cabhrú leat le rud ar bith a chabhraíonn leat a bheith ar fheabhas, i do laoch, nó díreach in am.<br/><br/>Chun ligean do Cortana eispéiris phearsanaithe agus molta‎í ábhartha a chur ar fáil, bailíonn agus úsáideann Microsoft faisnéis amhail do shuíomh, stair do shuíomhanna, teagmhálaithe, ionchur gutha, patrúin chainte agus lámhscríbhneoireachta, stair clóscríofa, stair chuardaigh, sonraí féilire, inneachar agus stair chumarsáide ó theachtaireachtaí agus ó fheidhmchláir, agus faisnéis eile ar do ghléas. I Microsoft Edge, bailíonn agus úsáideann Cortana do stair bhrabhsála. Is féidir leat mionathruithe a dhéanamh i gcónaí sa Leabhar nótaí ar an méid is cuimhin le Cortana, Cortana a dhíchumasú i Microsoft Edge agus Cortana a chasadh as go hiomlán.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Iontráil do phasfhocal
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Ar chúiseanna slándála, cuir isteach do phasfhocal uair amháin eile.
  \MicrosoftInternalMetadata\ContentChecksumValue:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: 2532485720
